%% Note E2: The effective value at each key is the <b>lower-ranked of the two layers</b> -
%%    crew_guards.effective_ratcheted :594, reached through crew_config.resolve_ratcheted :1006.
%% Note E3: Why: crew reads config out of CLONED repositories. A repo shipping install.policy: auto, or
